<title>HUNGARY: CESI INDEX DIPS, FINISHES AT 1,439.27 PTS.</title>
<headline>CESI INDEX DIPS, FINISHES AT 1,439.27 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index fell 7.74 points or 0.53 percent to 1,439.27 points on Friday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
